Switch Management package for pfSense.<br/>
Discovers and monitors network switches via SNMP polling. Collects per-port
statistics including traffic counters (bytes, packets), error counts, and
discard counts from the IF-MIB. Supports SNMPv1, v2c, and v3.<br/>
Port counter data is stored in RRD for graphing and SQLite for real-time
status display.
